      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Comfort him briefly",
          "consequence": "Care.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Find the kids",
          "consequence": "Mission.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "Velociraptors. Lex hides in cabinets. Tim freezes.",
      "sceneTitle": "Kitchen",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Distract them",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Trap them in the freezer",
          "consequence": "Smart.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "He says he should have been there for them. He sounds, briefly, like a grandfather and not a CEO.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hammond's Confession",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Forgive him later",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hold the line now",
          "consequence": "Mission.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "Lex types on the Unix system. The lights come on.",
      "sceneTitle": "Power Restoration",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Praise her",
          "consequence": "Care.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay alert",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "They are at the door. The door is glass.",
      "sceneTitle": "Raptors Outside",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Move the kids up",
          "consequence": "Save.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Distract the raptors",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "The big skeleton in the rotunda. You climb. The raptors follow.",
      "sceneTitle": "Climb the Bones",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Climb fast",
          "consequence": "Speed.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Climb carefully",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "The T. rex bursts in, takes one raptor, then another. The banner falls.",
      "sceneTitle": "T. Rex Returns",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Run for the helicopter",
          "consequence": "Speed.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay till the dust settles",
          "consequence": "Witness.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "Hammond, mute. Ellie. The kids in your arms.",
      "sceneTitle": "Helicopter Pad",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Hold them",
          "consequence": "Care.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at the island a last time",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "He, finally, agrees not to endorse the park. He looks small. He looks human.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hammond",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Be kind",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be honest",
          "consequence": "Truth.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "The birds, you realize, are dinosaurs. The window is full of pelicans.",
      "sceneTitle": "Flight Out",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Notice it",
          "consequence": "Joy.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sleep",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Press, cameras, no statement.",
      "sceneTitle": "Mainland",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "No statement",
          "consequence": "Discipline.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "A short statement",
          "consequence": "Public.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "Years later you visit a different lab. The science is, again, ahead of the ethics. You decide what to do.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Lab Visit",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Speak publicly",
          "consequence": "Voice.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Step away",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "Years on, coffee with Ellie. You both still wake at 4 a.m. sometimes.",
      "sceneTitle": "Coffee with Ellie",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Plan an article",
          "consequence": "Action.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_paper"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just enjoy the coffee",
          "consequence": "Heal.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_field"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_kids"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_paper",
      "text": "You and Ellie publish a long paper on de-extinction ethics. It becomes the standard syllabus. You don't, you decide, need to be the regulator. You just need to be the alarm.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Paper",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "The Paper"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_field",
      "text": "You return to paleontology. You discover, in a Montana dig, a fossil that, briefly, shakes the field. You realize the living dinosaurs were, for you, a detour.",
      "sceneTitle": "Back to the Field",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Back to the Field"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_kids",
      "text": "Lex becomes a programmer. Tim becomes a paleontologist. They both, separately, send you Christmas cards. The cards are, always, slightly nicer than yours.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Kids Grew Up",
      "choices": [],
